### 2. List payable applications. Each one shows its adoptionFee.
### Pick one that has a fee (not null) and note its adoptionApplicationId and adoptionFee.
# @name payable
GET {{PAWS.api_HostAddress}}/api/payments/payable-applications
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..KBUl2NISWy49pgaZMf_iaw9Hl7u6PFvRHWNToTaBvHw

###

### 3. TAMPER: wrong amount. Expect 400 "The adoption fee for this pet is ... The amount cannot be changed."
### Replace 5 with the adoptionApplicationId you picked in step 2.
POST {{PAWS.api_HostAddress}}/api/payments
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..KBUl2NISWy49pgaZMf_iaw9Hl7u6PFvRHWNToTaBvHw
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "adoptionApplicationId": 5,
  "type": "Adoption Fee",
  "amount": 1,
  "method": "Cash"
}

###

### 4. TAMPER: wrong type. Expect 400 "Only Adoption Fee payments can be recorded here..."
